{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.연음","src":"linking: the final consonant slides into the next syllable","tgt":"penyambungan bunyi: konsonan akhir pindah ke suku kata berikutnya"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.구개음화","src":"ㄷ / ㅌ before 이 are said ㅈ / ㅊ","tgt":"ㄷ / ㅌ sebelum 이 dibaca ㅈ / ㅊ"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.격음화","src":"ㅎ next to ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅈ makes them airy ㅋ ㅌ ㅍ ㅊ","tgt":"ㅎ di dekat ㄱ ㄷ ㅂ ㅈ membuatnya berembus: ㅋ ㅌ ㅍ ㅊ"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.경음화","src":"the next consonant becomes tense","tgt":"konsonan berikutnya menjadi tegang"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.비음화","src":"nasal: ㅂ ㄷ ㄱ soften to ㅁ ㄴ ㅇ before ㄴ / ㅁ","tgt":"nasalisasi: ㅂ ㄷ ㄱ menjadi ㅁ ㄴ ㅇ sebelum ㄴ / ㅁ"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.유음화","src":"ㄴ meets ㄹ: both become ㄹ","tgt":"ㄴ bertemu ㄹ: keduanya dibaca ㄹ"}
{"f":"trainer","id":"sound.rules.받침 중화","src":"final consonant neutralised to its basic sound","tgt":"konsonan akhir dibaca dengan bunyi dasarnya"}
